A Sinister Call to Arms        NannyMUD Times                         Page 7
by Kuruth

  Good? What is good?
  
  It is a path that self righteous fools follow. Good is directly linked with
  weakness. Bravery? Anyone willing to die in order to help someone else
  lacks a very basic instinct; survival. You must take all you can from
  life and give nothing back! Life is a quest for power. Fire is the
  ultimate example of power. Once given life, it spreads fast and furiously.
  It consumes and destroys everything around it in order to grow.
  
  Come, minions of evil. Take some time to terrorize Antharis and wait
  until the ground starts to tremble. Join the servants, find Molt, and
  kneel before him! When Moltentear errupts, in that moment, you will feel true
    power. Control the flame. Pillage and burn. Watch the weak suffer as they
    defend in vain. Amidst the helpless cries, in bloodsplattered
  intervals they will ask; Why? Why?! They will beg you to stop. Don't. This is
    the path they chose.
  
  After the chaos has ended and the ash has settled, take the time to
  admire your work. As you stand victorious in front of a ruined temple
  with the burnt, bloody, broken and bruised bodies of defenders at your
  feet, you will understand what it means to follow the good path; A life
  of unheard and unanswered prayers.
  
  Come. Destroy something beautiful.
  
  /Kuruth, the Nightmare in the Night.
